    <comment>- Update to version 2.5.3:
  * chore(release): v2.5.3
  * A remote database URL that cannot be used no longer shows its password (#5218)
  * Move to tablewriter v1 with the plugin SDK and pipe-fittings (#5215)
  * Update Go dependencies to their latest compatible releases. Closes #5122 (#5216)
  * [dep][go](deps): Bump github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 from 5.10.0 to 5.13.0 (#5208)
  * chore(fleet): enable dependencies chore, drop Dependabot version updates (#5214)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump goreleaser/goreleaser-action (#5170)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump actions/setup-go from 6.5.0 to 7.1.0 (#5171)
  * [dep][go](deps): Bump github.com/jedib0t/go-pretty/v6 (#5209)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump actions/upload-artifact from 4.6.2 to 7.0.2 (#5210)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump docker/setup-buildx-action (#5211)
  * Let the fleet's release-PR hook open the release PR (#5212)
  * fix(db_client): close rows of failed queries. Fixes #5054 (#5207)
  * fix(connection): report a failed save of connection state, closes #5058 (#5206)
  * fix(db_local): a new install dir stops only its own leftovers, closes #5158 (#5195)
  * chore(ci): drop the unused personal access token from acceptance tests. Closes #5175 (#5181)
  * Carry pg_hba.conf.d rules over on a Postgres upgrade. Fixes #5149 (#5200)
  * chore(ci): park shipyard-pr.yml link fix on line 2. Closes #5199 (#5204)
  * fix(db): leave the old pg_hba.conf alone during an upgrade. Fixes #5148 (#5198)
  * fix(db): clear the two go vet findings. closes #5141 (#5203)
  * fix(db): reject an oversized max-parallel value with a clear error, closes #5052 (#5202)
  * fix(config): report an unreadable plugin as an error, not as not installed. Fixes #5057 (#5201)
  * fix(interactive): fall back to plain input and log when highlighting fails (#5196)
  * fix(pluginmanager): send rate limiter changes to custom-named plugin instances, closes #5150 (#5194)
  * fix(connection): compare aggregator children with one separator, closes #5197 (#5205)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump actions/cache from 4.3.0 to 6.1.0 (#5172)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump actions/download-artifact from 5.0.0 to 8.0.2 (#5169)
  * chore(release): replace deprecated goreleaser options, closes #5179 (#5186)
  * ci: a ci job gates every PR check (#5189)
  * Find the release PR from the head branch when a record run was started by hand
  * chore(release): v2.5.2
  * Quote the service password and keep the SSL passphrase out of the command line, logs and errors (#5183)
  * fix(config): leave a malformed .spc file out of the workspace profile load, closes #5147 (#5182)
  * Keep the setup-unfinished marker in internal/ so a read-only db folder works, closes #5173 (#5180)
  * [dep][go](deps): Bump github.com/spf13/pflag from 1.0.9 to 1.1.0 (#5168)
  * Release through the shared release workflows (#5178)
  * chore: set the repo up for agent-fleet (#5174)
  * [dep][go](deps): Bump github.com/Masterminds/semver/v3 (#5125)
  * Remove a former teammate from the Dependabot config (#5167)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump geekyeggo/delete-artifact from 5.1.0 to 6.0.0 (#5011)
  * [dep][go](deps): Bump github.com/dustin/go-humanize from 1.0.1 to 1.1.0 (#5127)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump docker/login-action from 3.6.0 to 4.8.0 (#5128)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump golangci/golangci-lint-action (#5129)
  * [dep][actions](deps): Bump actions/checkout from 5.0.0 to 7.0.1 (#5130)
  * Harden GitHub Actions: pin actions to SHAs and set explicit permissions (#4965) (forwarded request 1400493 from ph03nix)</comment>
